# their other costs." Turn 1 Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt (Bot2 17) with its Mox Ruby; it goes to the graveyard. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Festival
# of Embers with the five Moxen, then casts the Bolt again out of its graveyard for {R} (the Mountain) and 1 life (Bot1 19), Bot2 14. The
